📊 Results
🎯 Training Accuracy & Loss

The results show both training and testing accuracy and loss of the proposed CNN model, indicating strong learning performance and good generalization.

The model achieved high accuracy during training and maintained stable performance on testing data, which demonstrates its effectiveness.

🖼️ Recognition Results

The model successfully recognized input images and correctly classified different samples such as “A”, “G”, and “S”, showing reliable classification performance across various inputs.

